<title>USA: MedPartners buys Family Physicians.</title>
<headline>MedPartners buys Family Physicians.</headline>
<dateline>LONG BEACH, Calif. 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>MedPartners Inc Friday said it acquired Family Physicians Group in Vancouver, Washington. Terms of the purchase were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Family Physicians has been a healthcare services provder in Vancouver and neighboring communities for 25 years.</p>
</text>
